  <ul>
    <li><strong>Pillar:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/shannoncarver/hackathon-may-2026/blob/main/docs/pillars/6-mcp-connectors.md">Pillar 6 — MCP connector inventory</a></li>
    <li><strong>Decision 0015 (centralized server):</strong> <a href="https://github.com/shannoncarver/hackathon-may-2026/blob/main/docs/decisions/0015-centralized-platform-mcp.md">Centralized Platform MCP Server with cross-account dispatch</a></li>
    <li><strong>Decision 0008 (per-agent registration):</strong> <a href="https://github.com/shannoncarver/hackathon-may-2026/blob/main/docs/decisions/0008-mcp-connectors.md">MCP connectors — Atlassian (initial), GitHub (follow-up)</a></li>
    <li><strong>Source — connector config:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/shannoncarver/hackathon-may-2026/blob/main/.mcp.json"><code>.mcp.json</code></a></li>
    <li><strong>Source — drift control:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/shannoncarver/hackathon-may-2026/blob/main/MCP_VERSION_CHANGELOG.md"><code>MCP_VERSION_CHANGELOG.md</code></a></li>
    <li><strong>Source — architecture review:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/shannoncarver/hackathon-may-2026/tree/main/docs/research/0015-centralized-platform-mcp"><code>docs/research/0015-centralized-platform-mcp/</code></a></li>
  </ul>
</ArticleLayout>
